(4222683, 608557, 46177, '<td valign="top">OK, you win!<br/>Ok I can''t understand why I only gave you a nine the first time, bumping to 10 and if there was anything higher you would get it.  Fantastic shot not to mention this is one of my all time favorite movies and this one of the best scene''s in it.  Wonderfully emotional shot.  This image just makes me want to go on forever about how much I love it.</td>', 'OK, you win!Ok I can''t understand why I only gave you a nine the first time, bumping to 10 and if there was anything higher you would get it.  Fantastic shot not to mention this is one of my all time favorite movies and this one of the best scene''s in it.  Wonderfully emotional shot.  This image just makes me want to go on forever about how much I love it.', '2007-11-05 10:24:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(4222684, 608754, 70375, '<td valign="top">I am not voting, just viewing and commenting a couple... I just have to say, this is going to win a blue ribbon. This is the best macro splash shot I have ever seen. You nailed the colours and the focus is sublime. It even looks like it has a head just like the movie. If this is Irene, WOW girl, all that practice has sure paid off, you get better and better!! If not, you should know that you and IreneM have a lot in common :) Let me be the first to congratulate you! LOL</td>', 'I am not voting, just viewing and commenting a couple... I just have to say, this is going to win a blue ribbon. This is the best macro splash shot I have ever seen. You nailed the colours and the focus is sublime. It even looks like it has a head just like the movie. If this is Irene, WOW girl, all that practice has sure paid off, you get better and better!! If not, you should know that you and IreneM have a lot in common :) Let me be the first to congratulate you! LOL', '2007-11-05 10:24:16.000000', NULL, 1),
