(4225074, 606507, 7485, '<td valign="top">Excellent lighting! The thing (stuffed animal?) in the foreground on the right is unfortunately too small to be recognizable and just ends up being a distraction (this image probably works great in full size)</td>', 'Excellent lighting! The thing (stuffed animal?) in the foreground on the right is unfortunately too small to be recognizable and just ends up being a distraction (this image probably works great in full size)', '2007-11-06 11:27:03.000000', NULL, 1),
