(4225149, 608975, 30214, '<td valign="top">i have no idea whether it is a scene from the movie, so I have to take your word fore it (it is not a scene technically, and I haven''t seen, even heard about, the movie). A great photo, though.</td>', 'i have no idea whether it is a scene from the movie, so I have to take your word fore it (it is not a scene technically, and I haven''t seen, even heard about, the movie). A great photo, though.', '2007-11-06 12:18:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(4225150, 608819, 30214, '<td valign="top">great shot!</td>', 'great shot!', '2007-11-06 12:18:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(4225152, 608880, 30214, '<td valign="top">you did a great job setting this up! if it was a real mouse it would be a killer shot, but even as is it is pretty darn good. One small nitpick: i think the focus is slightly behind the mouse.</td>', 'you did a great job setting this up! if it was a real mouse it would be a killer shot, but even as is it is pretty darn good. One small nitpick: i think the focus is slightly behind the mouse.', '2007-11-06 12:21:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(4225156, 608615, 79128, '<td valign="top">Its too blurry with too much movement.</td>', 'Its too blurry with too much movement.', '2007-11-06 12:22:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(4225160, 609050, 30214, '<td valign="top">great lighting and composition. I wish the guy in the back did not smile...<br/> <br/>Edit: I take my critique back. I just looked up the poster, and Ed Norton is smiling there indeed. Sorry! :)<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2007-11-12 22:52:09.</i></td>', 'great lighting and composition. I wish the guy in the back did not smile... Edit: I take my critique back. I just looked up the poster, and Ed Norton is smiling there indeed. Sorry! :)', '2007-11-06 12:23:37.000000', '2007-11-12 22:52:09.000000', 1),
(4225180, 607688, 67152, '<td valign="top">This is a fabulous image - the composition is stunning - especially the placement of the house and dog behind the man - and the man is so full of life and dignity.  I don''t know the film but I trust you on this one.</td>', 'This is a fabulous image - the composition is stunning - especially the placement of the house and dog behind the man - and the man is so full of life and dignity.  I don''t know the film but I trust you on this one.', '2007-11-06 12:37:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(4225184, 607980, 67152, '<td valign="top">The subdued colors works pretty well here (being that the original was in b/w).  The grain also seems to fit but the vignette seems to be a bit too much for me - i would have liked it a bit better with more starkness of light throughout.b</td>', 'The subdued colors works pretty well here (being that the original was in b/w).  The grain also seems to fit but the vignette seems to be a bit too much for me - i would have liked it a bit better with more starkness of light throughout.b', '2007-11-06 12:40:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(4225185, 608858, 67152, '<td valign="top">Very well photographed - good focus and great facial expression.  I think the title doesn''t quite work for me - I would have lost the (with a twist) - it distracts the connection to the original.</td>', 'Very well photographed - good focus and great facial expression.  I think the title doesn''t quite work for me - I would have lost the (with a twist) - it distracts the connection to the original.', '2007-11-06 12:41:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(4225194, 608731, 67152, '<td valign="top">This is a technically solid and quality portrait.  I have come back to this a couple of times and even went looking for a connection to the movie.  I think what hurts this image is the connection to a movie - The movie of this name that I know is about a woman trying to raise her baby in prison and I really don''t see a connection to it here. still it gets a 6 for quality of image</td>', 'This is a technically solid and quality portrait.  I have come back to this a couple of times and even went looking for a connection to the movie.  I think what hurts this image is the connection to a movie - The movie of this name that I know is about a woman trying to raise her baby in prison and I really don''t see a connection to it here. still it gets a 6 for quality of image', '2007-11-06 12:48:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(4225206, 606354, 67152, '<td valign="top">Really nice studio shot - i like the look of the girl and the handsome man playing Johnny.  The one thing about the shot that bothers me a bit is that it does look like a studio photo shoot rather than a movie shoot - Johnny looking at us doesn''t work for me - I would rather a steely-eyed focus away from us.<br/> <br/>I think giving us the title of the movie "The Wild One" instead of the famous line would have helped your score.  It''s a good shot - i just worry it will suffer because people may not know the connection.</td>', 'Really nice studio shot - i like the look of the girl and the handsome man playing Johnny.  The one thing about the shot that bothers me a bit is that it does look like a studio photo shoot rather than a movie shoot - Johnny looking at us doesn''t work for me - I would rather a steely-eyed focus away from us. I think giving us the title of the movie "The Wild One" instead of the famous line would have helped your score.  It''s a good shot - i just worry it will suffer because people may not know the connection.', '2007-11-06 12:54:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(4225207, 608913, 67152, '<td valign="top">I sort of remember this movie but I am not sure that this shot really grabs my impression of the movie - i just recall the line up with the five suspects...  The angle of the shot is pretty solid - i like the low angle to emphasize the power of the police and the weakness of the suspect.</td>', 'I sort of remember this movie but I am not sure that this shot really grabs my impression of the movie - i just recall the line up with the five suspects...  The angle of the shot is pretty solid - i like the low angle to emphasize the power of the police and the weakness of the suspect.', '2007-11-06 12:57:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(4225208, 608822, 67152, '<td valign="top">i like the glow created by the ring - well done touch.  I am not really sure I like the grain in the face, however.   The nose and under the eyes seem a bit too pixelated</td>', 'i like the glow created by the ring - well done touch.  I am not really sure I like the grain in the face, however.   The nose and under the eyes seem a bit too pixelated', '2007-11-06 12:58:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(4225209, 608275, 67152, '<td valign="top">That is one creepy silhouette.  I can just see Freddy waiting for night to take control.  I think showing his razor hands in the silhouette and more of a street shot of Elm Street may have made the connection more direct for the voters.</td>', 'That is one creepy silhouette.  I can just see Freddy waiting for night to take control.  I think showing his razor hands in the silhouette and more of a street shot of Elm Street may have made the connection more direct for the voters.', '2007-11-06 12:59:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(4225214, 608368, 67152, '<td valign="top">I like the tones of the image and the lighting on the blanket/cover.  The composition is really good and the backdrop for the shot is very beautiful.</td>', 'I like the tones of the image and the lighting on the blanket/cover.  The composition is really good and the backdrop for the shot is very beautiful.', '2007-11-06 13:02:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(4225219, 609050, 25728, '<td valign="top">This is the movie poster, not a scene so your gong to get hammered for that by the DNMC nuts. However - you are SPOT on. Even the colors in the kick light are perfect. You even nailed Edward Nortons expression. The only thing that is missing is the concrete in the background. Good job, this one of my top three.</td>', 'This is the movie poster, not a scene so your gong to get hammered for that by the DNMC nuts. However - you are SPOT on. Even the colors in the kick light are perfect. You even nailed Edward Nortons expression. The only thing that is missing is the concrete in the background. Good job, this one of my top three.', '2007-11-06 13:09:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(4225220, 608558, 67152, '<td valign="top">Nice and crisp shot - love the water flow, the facial expression and the knife.    <br/> <br/>I am just a bit troubled by the blood on the wall - not by the violence but my first thought is .."Why is it there before she has been stabbed?"   The blood actually pulls my eyes away from the knife.  <br/> <br/>I know it''s a bit much to ask...and I am not really marking it down...but the original had a blonde in it with shorter hair.  I would just imagine that others might vote it down because it doesn''t quite look the same as the original.  Good shot 6</td>', 'Nice and crisp shot - love the water flow, the facial expression and the knife.     I am just a bit troubled by the blood on the wall - not by the violence but my first thought is .."Why is it there before she has been stabbed?"   The blood actually pulls my eyes away from the knife.   I know it''s a bit much to ask...and I am not really marking it down...but the original had a blonde in it with shorter hair.  I would just imagine that others might vote it down because it doesn''t quite look the same as the original.  Good shot 6', '2007-11-06 13:09:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(4225221, 608979, 67152, '<td valign="top">I like this pyscho shot - this one shows the terror in her face and really seems to capture the essense of the movie</td>', 'I like this pyscho shot - this one shows the terror in her face and really seems to capture the essense of the movie', '2007-11-06 13:10:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(4225222, 608819, 67152, '<td valign="top">Excellent capture of jets in flight - love the details and the placement of the jets.</td>', 'Excellent capture of jets in flight - love the details and the placement of the jets.', '2007-11-06 13:11:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(4225229, 608612, 67152, '<td valign="top">This is such a cool shot - i love how we see the three faces of this woman.  I am just glad i came back to it so I could up the score!</td>', 'This is such a cool shot - i love how we see the three faces of this woman.  I am just glad i came back to it so I could up the score!', '2007-11-06 13:14:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(4225230, 608937, 67152, '<td valign="top">Cool pose and use of negative space.  I wish the one pant leg was not as blown out</td>', 'Cool pose and use of negative space.  I wish the one pant leg was not as blown out', '2007-11-06 13:14:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(4225231, 607811, 83350, '<td valign="top">Pegged it!! Great shot - hope you do well!!</td>', 'Pegged it!! Great shot - hope you do well!!', '2007-11-06 13:16:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(4225233, 608685, 83350, '<td valign="top">Cheesy mustache and all.....GREAT SHOT, a 10 in my book!!</td>', 'Cheesy mustache and all.....GREAT SHOT, a 10 in my book!!', '2007-11-06 13:17:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(4225234, 609004, 67152, '<td valign="top">This is quite a dramatic interpretation of the movie.  Clearly it shows the List well and the macro is a unique take for this challenge, but I worry that the choice of those two letters may be taken the wrong way and may impact your score.</td>', 'This is quite a dramatic interpretation of the movie.  Clearly it shows the List well and the macro is a unique take for this challenge, but I worry that the choice of those two letters may be taken the wrong way and may impact your score.', '2007-11-06 13:17:15.000000', NULL, 1),
