(4233820, 608558, 20330, '<td valign="top">The blood spray on the wall behind her doesnt flow with the image, it seems out of place. I think a shot without it would have been stronger. Her facial expression is good, but she looks pretty, and if I were screaming for my life I dont think I would look that pretty lol. I think the editing is really nice, sharp, clean, focused. Also, this shot has been done to death, to do something like this you have to be almost perfect, this is close... just a few things keep me from scoring it higher than 7. so.. 7! Good Luck :)</td>', 'The blood spray on the wall behind her doesnt flow with the image, it seems out of place. I think a shot without it would have been stronger. Her facial expression is good, but she looks pretty, and if I were screaming for my life I dont think I would look that pretty lol. I think the editing is really nice, sharp, clean, focused. Also, this shot has been done to death, to do something like this you have to be almost perfect, this is close... just a few things keep me from scoring it higher than 7. so.. 7! Good Luck :)', '2007-11-09 00:00:12.000000', NULL, 1),
