(4236590, 608669, 68586, '<td valign="top">Really classy shot.<br/> <br/>There are so many things to like in this - the clump of trees filling the gap between the reeds, the mist on the water, the reeds leaning over rather than straight up, the reflections . . all in all a very nice shot.</td>', 'Really classy shot. There are so many things to like in this - the clump of trees filling the gap between the reeds, the mist on the water, the reeds leaning over rather than straight up, the reflections . . all in all a very nice shot.', '2007-11-10 08:00:29.000000', NULL, 1),
