(4237516, 608981, 1054, '<td valign="top">One of my favorite movies, and one of my favorite paintings. Here''s one of my attempts from the early days on the site:<br/> <br/><a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=5594" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_challenge/0-999/32/120/5594.jpg'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_challenge/0-999/32/120/5594.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_challenge/0-999/32/120/5594.jpg"/></a> <br/> <br/>Since that challenge was in Basic, I couldn''t clone out fishing line. I had to skewer the apple on the end of a wooden spoon, and hold the spoon in my mouth!<br/> <br/>A 10 from me for brilliant execution.</td>', 'One of my favorite movies, and one of my favorite paintings. Here''s one of my attempts from the early days on the site:   Since that challenge was in Basic, I couldn''t clone out fishing line. I had to skewer the apple on the end of a wooden spoon, and hold the spoon in my mouth! A 10 from me for brilliant execution.', '2007-11-10 19:04:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(4237521, 608962, 1054, '<td valign="top">Nice re-enactment. Photographically, the glare off the light switch and door is a bit distracting. Perhaps you could have moved the camera to the left a little and changed the angle slightly to eliminate this?</td>', 'Nice re-enactment. Photographically, the glare off the light switch and door is a bit distracting. Perhaps you could have moved the camera to the left a little and changed the angle slightly to eliminate this?', '2007-11-10 19:08:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(4237523, 608519, 1054, '<td valign="top">Nice, dynamic photo, good lighting, but with the elbow and feet cut off I feel this is an overly tight crop.</td>', 'Nice, dynamic photo, good lighting, but with the elbow and feet cut off I feel this is an overly tight crop.', '2007-11-10 19:10:14.000000', NULL, 1),
