(4238830, 608822, 16197, '<td valign="top">Maybe a bit to small, but the first of the several in the challenge that I am viewing full size.  I do enjoy how the eyes and the ring pop out in the image, but not sure about the soft/blur and the hand appears a bit disjointed as well.</td>', 'Maybe a bit to small, but the first of the several in the challenge that I am viewing full size.  I do enjoy how the eyes and the ring pop out in the image, but not sure about the soft/blur and the hand appears a bit disjointed as well.', '2007-11-11 17:47:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(4238833, 608975, 16197, '<td valign="top">no idea what this is, but I enjoy the textures and depth.  The single light source fading to black is nice.  Now, as I continue to look at this image I see a couple birds flying, easily missed and I feel does not hold strong enough to give me a sense of what you are trying to portray</td>', 'no idea what this is, but I enjoy the textures and depth.  The single light source fading to black is nice.  Now, as I continue to look at this image I see a couple birds flying, easily missed and I feel does not hold strong enough to give me a sense of what you are trying to portray', '2007-11-11 17:49:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(4238835, 608612, 16197, '<td valign="top">I am not familiar with this scene.  It is very clean looking, and the separations and reflections are interesting.  But not knowing exactly what you are trying to show it makes it difficult to understand.</td>', 'I am not familiar with this scene.  It is very clean looking, and the separations and reflections are interesting.  But not knowing exactly what you are trying to show it makes it difficult to understand.', '2007-11-11 17:51:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(4238840, 608121, 16197, '<td valign="top">I enjoy the clarity of this version better than the last I saw.  However, I also enjoy the way the eyes and ring stood out on the other one.  I feel a bit more pop in the eyes and ring would have really made this a strong image.  The green wrap and hair work out nicely.</td>', 'I enjoy the clarity of this version better than the last I saw.  However, I also enjoy the way the eyes and ring stood out on the other one.  I feel a bit more pop in the eyes and ring would have really made this a strong image.  The green wrap and hair work out nicely.', '2007-11-11 17:53:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(4238841, 608981, 53781, '<td valign="top">Very nice! I love the movie and the painting The Son of Man by René Magritte. You have captured this nicely.</td>', 'Very nice! I love the movie and the painting The Son of Man by René Magritte. You have captured this nicely.', '2007-11-11 17:53:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(4238845, 607486, 16197, '<td valign="top">I chose not to watch this movie, I wasn''t interested in the storyline and from viewing this image I believe I made the right choice.  Here I see a body of water with a reflection that I personally find unappealing.  Also, by seeing the stones through the water it does not seem all that deep thus eliminating the credibility of the title.</td>', 'I chose not to watch this movie, I wasn''t interested in the storyline and from viewing this image I believe I made the right choice.  Here I see a body of water with a reflection that I personally find unappealing.  Also, by seeing the stones through the water it does not seem all that deep thus eliminating the credibility of the title.', '2007-11-11 17:55:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(4238846, 608557, 53781, '<td valign="top">I love this movie and you have captured this scene and the emotion wonderfully!</td>', 'I love this movie and you have captured this scene and the emotion wonderfully!', '2007-11-11 17:55:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(4238848, 607688, 16197, '<td valign="top">Doing something obscure is always a risk.  There is no proper way to judge the image if there is not an understanding of where it came from, specially in a challenge where it is ''supposed'' to be from a movie.  With that being said, I find this a very fine image, I enjoy the character, however the foreground brokah of his hand is very distracting.</td>', 'Doing something obscure is always a risk.  There is no proper way to judge the image if there is not an understanding of where it came from, specially in a challenge where it is ''supposed'' to be from a movie.  With that being said, I find this a very fine image, I enjoy the character, however the foreground brokah of his hand is very distracting.', '2007-11-11 17:56:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(4238849, 608731, 16197, '<td valign="top">I am not familiar with this scene and from what I see the image is soft, smooth and canted to the side.  Not really sure what to think I personally don''t care for the image, but I am sure others do.</td>', 'I am not familiar with this scene and from what I see the image is soft, smooth and canted to the side.  Not really sure what to think I personally don''t care for the image, but I am sure others do.', '2007-11-11 17:57:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(4238851, 608861, 16197, '<td valign="top">Gotta love the classics.  For this I think the tone works nicely, however I would have liked a bit more on her makeup.  A bit stronger on the makeup I believe would really have created a strong image.</td>', 'Gotta love the classics.  For this I think the tone works nicely, however I would have liked a bit more on her makeup.  A bit stronger on the makeup I believe would really have created a strong image.', '2007-11-11 17:58:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(4238854, 608858, 16197, '<td valign="top">Not sure what you mean with a twist, but I have to say I dislike how his eyes are being pulled down and droopy.  The image itself technically is very sharp and strong.  Yet, from the movie he did this famous pose when he put aftershave on his face and it burned.  This gives me no semblance of the movie and without the title I wouldn''t have made the connection.</td>', 'Not sure what you mean with a twist, but I have to say I dislike how his eyes are being pulled down and droopy.  The image itself technically is very sharp and strong.  Yet, from the movie he did this famous pose when he put aftershave on his face and it burned.  This gives me no semblance of the movie and without the title I wouldn''t have made the connection.', '2007-11-11 18:00:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(4238859, 608162, 16197, '<td valign="top">Pod People, I enjoy the shadowed figure on the pod.  A very nice touch, however this image just doesn''t feel very strong.  IT is fun, but doesn''t give me Body Snatchers.</td>', 'Pod People, I enjoy the shadowed figure on the pod.  A very nice touch, however this image just doesn''t feel very strong.  IT is fun, but doesn''t give me Body Snatchers.', '2007-11-11 18:01:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(4238861, 608869, 16197, '<td valign="top">I don''t know this scene and personally find it rather dull and unappealing.</td>', 'I don''t know this scene and personally find it rather dull and unappealing.', '2007-11-11 18:01:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(4238863, 608691, 16197, '<td valign="top">I would have loved to see a really strong image here, with sharp crystal clarity and separation from the background.</td>', 'I would have loved to see a really strong image here, with sharp crystal clarity and separation from the background.', '2007-11-11 18:02:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(4238864, 608938, 16197, '<td valign="top">How very fun, however for me, it seems the wagon is in sharper focus than the young lady.  I would have preferred her to stand out a bit more.</td>', 'How very fun, however for me, it seems the wagon is in sharper focus than the young lady.  I would have preferred her to stand out a bit more.', '2007-11-11 18:03:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(4238865, 606677, 16197, '<td valign="top">Tried to watch this movie, didn''t make it very far.  However This image here feels more like a snapshot with direct flash that some people just ''happened'' to catch.</td>', 'Tried to watch this movie, didn''t make it very far.  However This image here feels more like a snapshot with direct flash that some people just ''happened'' to catch.', '2007-11-11 18:04:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(4238867, 608868, 16197, '<td valign="top">I enjoyed the movie, and if watched once every 5 years or so it is still enjoyable.  However, for this image here, I feel it does not exactly portray the film.  May perhaps have the focus more so on the tender on the lighting of fire and not so much on the model.  I think if the starting of fire was more of the focus point it would have been a very strong image.</td>', 'I enjoyed the movie, and if watched once every 5 years or so it is still enjoyable.  However, for this image here, I feel it does not exactly portray the film.  May perhaps have the focus more so on the tender on the lighting of fire and not so much on the model.  I think if the starting of fire was more of the focus point it would have been a very strong image.', '2007-11-11 18:05:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(4238868, 608873, 16197, '<td valign="top">I am not sure what to think of this image.  I think maybe if her face was a bit more under the water it may have been stronger and give more of a sense of the movie.  Maybe even all the way under, just under the surface and a wider shot so to see the hair floating around.</td>', 'I am not sure what to think of this image.  I think maybe if her face was a bit more under the water it may have been stronger and give more of a sense of the movie.  Maybe even all the way under, just under the surface and a wider shot so to see the hair floating around.', '2007-11-11 18:07:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(4238869, 608285, 16197, '<td valign="top">This is nice, I think it was well done and the border was a nice touch, it may not be 13/9 but it gives a feeling of.</td>', 'This is nice, I think it was well done and the border was a nice touch, it may not be 13/9 but it gives a feeling of.', '2007-11-11 18:08:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(4238873, 608445, 16197, '<td valign="top">This image just is... to me, the brighter parts are blurred and the darker parts are almost in focus.  I would have liked to see more light on his face and perhaps less on his hands and arms.  That would have given me a stronger focus point and a stronger image.</td>', 'This image just is... to me, the brighter parts are blurred and the darker parts are almost in focus.  I would have liked to see more light on his face and perhaps less on his hands and arms.  That would have given me a stronger focus point and a stronger image.', '2007-11-11 18:09:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(4238874, 607556, 16197, '<td valign="top">This is a fun image, and the woodie is a nice touch, however the ''cutout'' of the gears is a distraction.</td>', 'This is a fun image, and the woodie is a nice touch, however the ''cutout'' of the gears is a distraction.', '2007-11-11 18:11:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(4238876, 608913, 16197, '<td valign="top">I find it a distraction to see so much blur on the officer on the far right.  As well as the light spot coming in, he is the main focus and really takes away from the rest of the image.  The bright spot on the officer on the far left is also a major distraction.</td>', 'I find it a distraction to see so much blur on the officer on the far right.  As well as the light spot coming in, he is the main focus and really takes away from the rest of the image.  The bright spot on the officer on the far left is also a major distraction.', '2007-11-11 18:13:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(4238879, 608368, 16197, '<td valign="top">I enjoy this idea, but a few things I think would have made this stronger.  For one a wider band to be the ''ring'' The way it looks now, it seems like a keychain ring.  Also, I would have liked to see the arm out more, or more emotion from holding the chain.  The way it looks now is as if it doesn''t matter much.  Just a ring no biggie.  In the movies, most the characters held the ring with fists, or the chain with a closed fist.  The ring is power, but I do not see the power here.</td>', 'I enjoy this idea, but a few things I think would have made this stronger.  For one a wider band to be the ''ring'' The way it looks now, it seems like a keychain ring.  Also, I would have liked to see the arm out more, or more emotion from holding the chain.  The way it looks now is as if it doesn''t matter much.  Just a ring no biggie.  In the movies, most the characters held the ring with fists, or the chain with a closed fist.  The ring is power, but I do not see the power here.', '2007-11-11 18:15:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(4238881, 608865, 16197, '<td valign="top">Very interesting image here.  I am not familiar with the scene and the model house and glow worm seem rather silly.  Interesting all the same though.</td>', 'Very interesting image here.  I am not familiar with the scene and the model house and glow worm seem rather silly.  Interesting all the same though.', '2007-11-11 18:16:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(4238884, 606354, 16197, '<td valign="top">He looks to clean cut to be a rebel.  I also don''t care much for her pose, that looking up really isn''t that flattering in my opinion.  However it does seem like a very clean image.</td>', 'He looks to clean cut to be a rebel.  I also don''t care much for her pose, that looking up really isn''t that flattering in my opinion.  However it does seem like a very clean image.', '2007-11-11 18:17:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(4238887, 608558, 16197, '<td valign="top">I like the idea, however two things I see very wrong, the blood already on the walls and I can barely see/make out the knife.  In the scene or at least my vision of the scene the knife is very prevalent and the star of the scene, the girl in the shower is just a victim.  Here you have it in reverse.</td>', 'I like the idea, however two things I see very wrong, the blood already on the walls and I can barely see/make out the knife.  In the scene or at least my vision of the scene the knife is very prevalent and the star of the scene, the girl in the shower is just a victim.  Here you have it in reverse.', '2007-11-11 18:18:52.000000', NULL, 1),
