(4238938, 608822, 34659, '<td valign="top">The blue in his eyes is a little too much (just a hair over what I think might be more effective).  However, the lighting on his face and hand/ring are superb.   Plus, this is my favorite movie series (and book trilogy) of all time.  Well done.</td>', 'The blue in his eyes is a little too much (just a hair over what I think might be more effective).  However, the lighting on his face and hand/ring are superb.   Plus, this is my favorite movie series (and book trilogy) of all time.  Well done.', '2007-11-11 19:10:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(4238941, 609026, 34659, '<td valign="top">Beautiful representation/duplication of this infamous poster/marketing program.   Very well done.  The noise is just right and the tones are terrific.   The bug looks a tad bit on the "papery" side (cut/paste), but it''s a very minor distraction.   Excellent work.</td>', 'Beautiful representation/duplication of this infamous poster/marketing program.   Very well done.  The noise is just right and the tones are terrific.   The bug looks a tad bit on the "papery" side (cut/paste), but it''s a very minor distraction.   Excellent work.', '2007-11-11 19:11:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(4238942, 608836, 16197, '<td valign="top">This is a fun image, I think the wrinkles in the backdrop work nicely.  However, his hands and arms bother me.  I would have really enjoyed something a bit more inside more as if he is getting ready for the switch.</td>', 'This is a fun image, I think the wrinkles in the backdrop work nicely.  However, his hands and arms bother me.  I would have really enjoyed something a bit more inside more as if he is getting ready for the switch.', '2007-11-11 19:12:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(4238943, 608754, 34659, '<td valign="top">I just watched this movie again last night - love it!   Very cool interpretation here, making the most of what you''ve achieved with this liquid sculpture.  Nice work.</td>', 'I just watched this movie again last night - love it!   Very cool interpretation here, making the most of what you''ve achieved with this liquid sculpture.  Nice work.', '2007-11-11 19:12:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(4238945, 608437, 16197, '<td valign="top">I don''t remember the final scene so for me it must not have been very strong.  Looking at this image I gain no sense of the movie or the scene.  I personally find it rather uninteresting.</td>', 'I don''t remember the final scene so for me it must not have been very strong.  Looking at this image I gain no sense of the movie or the scene.  I personally find it rather uninteresting.', '2007-11-11 19:13:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(4238946, 608979, 16197, '<td valign="top">I gain no feel from the movie Psycho and your image.  I can not tell she is in the shower, and I can not see why she would be screaming.  With her eyes mostly closed it also creates an odd feeling, like maybe just opening her mouth without really screaming just a pose.  I enjoy the b/w and bit of texture and feel that works just not everything as a whole.</td>', 'I gain no feel from the movie Psycho and your image.  I can not tell she is in the shower, and I can not see why she would be screaming.  With her eyes mostly closed it also creates an odd feeling, like maybe just opening her mouth without really screaming just a pose.  I enjoy the b/w and bit of texture and feel that works just not everything as a whole.', '2007-11-11 19:15:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(4238947, 607148, 16197, '<td valign="top">That is a nice splash there.  I have not seen the movie, yet just something about this image bothers me.</td>', 'That is a nice splash there.  I have not seen the movie, yet just something about this image bothers me.', '2007-11-11 19:16:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(4238949, 607980, 16197, '<td valign="top">I don''t remember a scene with so much blood going down the drain.  Unless you are doing a more recent version.  Yet for me, I would have liked to be able to know the movie from the scene, this could be from any number of movies and not one in particular.</td>', 'I don''t remember a scene with so much blood going down the drain.  Unless you are doing a more recent version.  Yet for me, I would have liked to be able to know the movie from the scene, this could be from any number of movies and not one in particular.', '2007-11-11 19:17:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(4238952, 608937, 16197, '<td valign="top">I think this model would have been able to pull off Judah from ''Crow - City of Angels'' Maybe thats what you are thinking?  However, it would have been much better for you to stick closer to the movie rather than have some guy on a stool.  The technical aspects are good, just not the portray of your title.</td>', 'I think this model would have been able to pull off Judah from ''Crow - City of Angels'' Maybe thats what you are thinking?  However, it would have been much better for you to stick closer to the movie rather than have some guy on a stool.  The technical aspects are good, just not the portray of your title.', '2007-11-11 19:21:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(4238954, 608754, 16197, '<td valign="top">Interesting concept, I think this would have been a ribbon contender if a different angle or perspective was taken.  In the Abyss I remember the ''creature'' coming towards from the water, more horizontal than vertical.  I understand this is a splash, but I am sure there is a way to get a different angle for movement.  The technical aspects however are very crisp and clean. very well done.</td>', 'Interesting concept, I think this would have been a ribbon contender if a different angle or perspective was taken.  In the Abyss I remember the ''creature'' coming towards from the water, more horizontal than vertical.  I understand this is a splash, but I am sure there is a way to get a different angle for movement.  The technical aspects however are very crisp and clean. very well done.', '2007-11-11 19:22:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(4238956, 608767, 16197, '<td valign="top">A bit more arch backwards and a bucket of water splashing down, or even just a rope hanging down would have really made this a ribbon winner in my book.  I knew what the movie was from first glance, but feel it just needs those extra elements to really make it great.  I enjoy your lighting elements and they are very well done.</td>', 'A bit more arch backwards and a bucket of water splashing down, or even just a rope hanging down would have really made this a ribbon winner in my book.  I knew what the movie was from first glance, but feel it just needs those extra elements to really make it great.  I enjoy your lighting elements and they are very well done.', '2007-11-11 19:24:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(4238959, 607392, 16197, '<td valign="top">This would have worked better if it was not taken in a showroom.  However, personally I wanted to see the BMW Bug to be BumbleBee, the bug was always my fav, yet, they seem to think just cause its yellow and black its bumblebee.  Anyway, yes, the reflections of the light and showroom are a huge distraction, and would have been a lot nicer outside, or somewhere to really give it a strong element of the movie.</td>', 'This would have worked better if it was not taken in a showroom.  However, personally I wanted to see the BMW Bug to be BumbleBee, the bug was always my fav, yet, they seem to think just cause its yellow and black its bumblebee.  Anyway, yes, the reflections of the light and showroom are a huge distraction, and would have been a lot nicer outside, or somewhere to really give it a strong element of the movie.', '2007-11-11 19:28:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(4238962, 608802, 16197, '<td valign="top">Interesting take, however the elements really look fake to me.  As if the pen cap and bear were photographed separately and added together.  Yet, it really doesn''t do anything for the movie, no way for me to even guess what it would have been if the title wasn''t there.</td>', 'Interesting take, however the elements really look fake to me.  As if the pen cap and bear were photographed separately and added together.  Yet, it really doesn''t do anything for the movie, no way for me to even guess what it would have been if the title wasn''t there.', '2007-11-11 19:30:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(4238963, 606697, 16197, '<td valign="top">I really don''t care for the processing here.  I enjoy the border, just nothing done to the image.  Also the model appears to be more irritated than anything.  The model in the movie held a different type of emotion and the difference is dramatic.</td>', 'I really don''t care for the processing here.  I enjoy the border, just nothing done to the image.  Also the model appears to be more irritated than anything.  The model in the movie held a different type of emotion and the difference is dramatic.', '2007-11-11 19:31:47.000000', NULL, 1),
