(4239288, 607556, 6804, '<td valign="top">Modern Times is one of my all time favorites.  I stopped to glance at your clock works here and then I noticed the cut-out lines and.  They aren''t all too noticeable or offensive, but a black magic marker on the edges would fix you right up. It was only after that I noticed woodie was in the picture. He''s not easy to see at first glance, but.... I''m old. I do hope others stop here long enough to see the creative brilliance in this one. It''s excellent!<br/>High marks from me.</td>', 'Modern Times is one of my all time favorites.  I stopped to glance at your clock works here and then I noticed the cut-out lines and.  They aren''t all too noticeable or offensive, but a black magic marker on the edges would fix you right up. It was only after that I noticed woodie was in the picture. He''s not easy to see at first glance, but.... I''m old. I do hope others stop here long enough to see the creative brilliance in this one. It''s excellent!High marks from me.', '2007-11-11 22:06:15.000000', NULL, 1),
