(4239691, 606677, 70484, '<td valign="top">Hey there, good attempt. Make sure to read through all the comments, people are giving good feedback. That will help you to become a better photographer. You are getting better, but night shots with on camera flash are very difficult to get right. Keep coming up with these great ideas and then practice, practice, practice. You''ll get it!</td>', 'Hey there, good attempt. Make sure to read through all the comments, people are giving good feedback. That will help you to become a better photographer. You are getting better, but night shots with on camera flash are very difficult to get right. Keep coming up with these great ideas and then practice, practice, practice. You''ll get it!', '2007-11-12 00:40:28.000000', NULL, 0),
