(4255550, 608858, 67152, '<td valign="top">I already commented on this one during voting, but back for another thought since you put it in the ''sweet/sour'' side challenge.  Good use of centered crop and nice job with the bright colors and blank background.  I think the eyes are a bit too much pulled down - but as you said, working with kids can be tough.  Nice work (and nice finish)</td>', 'I already commented on this one during voting, but back for another thought since you put it in the ''sweet/sour'' side challenge.  Good use of centered crop and nice job with the bright colors and blank background.  I think the eyes are a bit too much pulled down - but as you said, working with kids can be tough.  Nice work (and nice finish)', '2007-11-18 14:04:53.000000', NULL, 0),
(4256331, 608854, 66635, '<td valign="top">Great picture.  Great movie.  I like your explanation for the use of the foam head; I think it''s a great idea to try to suggest uncertainty about gender.  But it didn''t actually work for me in this case because I still see a foam head.  Maybe you should just do one of two masked women kissing? Ok, PLEASE!!! ;-)</td>', 'Great picture.  Great movie.  I like your explanation for the use of the foam head; I think it''s a great idea to try to suggest uncertainty about gender.  But it didn''t actually work for me in this case because I still see a foam head.  Maybe you should just do one of two masked women kissing? Ok, PLEASE!!! ;-)', '2007-11-18 21:50:25.000000', NULL, 0),
